    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d464">

                <pb facs="0690" n="674" sameAs="frus:frus1947v04/pg674"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.24/4–547: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Smith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret   us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-04-05T17:00:00+03:00">April 5, 1947—5 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1201. Personal for Acheson from Smith. Just finished discussion with
                        Molotov<anchor n="1" xml:id="d464-f1"/> who informs me officially that
                    Soviet Government is now prepared immediately to commence discussions in
                    connection with Lend-Lease settlement. The Soviet representatives will be
                    designated at once and will be headed by Mikoyan.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d464-f2"
                    /> Further details in following message. I informed Molotov that we would
                    receive from the US within very short time indication of place and tentative
                    date for beginning of conference. Have just informed Secretary who concurs.
                    Molotov understands that these discussions are purely on subject of Lend-Lease
                    settlement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d464-f1" n="1" xml:id="d464-f1-content">
                <p>Vyacheslav Mikhailovich Molotov, Minister for Foreign Affairs of the Soviet
                    Union.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d464-f2" n="2" xml:id="d464-f2-content">
                <p>Anastas Ivanovich Mikoyan, Minister for Foreign Trade of the Soviet Union.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
